@deftypefn {} {@var{pdf} =} empirical_pdf (@var{x}, @var{data})
For each element of @var{x}, compute the probability density function (PDF)
at @var{x} of the empirical distribution obtained from the
univariate sample @var{data}.
@end deftypefn


